<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Endurance</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Target 61g carbs/hr. Practice this prescription.

Endurance Blocks — level 3

WARM-UP:
-10min ramp 50%->65% FTP (RPE 2-3)

MAIN SET:
-90min @ 60%-70% FTP (Z2, RPE 2-3, 85-95rpm)

COOL-DOWN:
-10min spin-down 65%->50% FTP (RPE 2-3)

HOW TO RIDE IT:
-Easy and conversational the whole way.

FUEL:
-61 g/hr.</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="600" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.65" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="92"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="5400" Power="0.65" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="95"/>
    <Cooldown Duration="600" PowerLow="0.65" PowerHigh="0.50" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="95"/>
  </workout>
</workout_file>